# Cloudflare Workers Static Assets redirect rules.
# https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/static-assets/redirects/
#
# Sigil keeps its documentation on its own Starlight site, so /sigil here is a
# signpost rather than a section. Both rules send readers to the Sigil docs home
# rather than mapping deep paths across, because the path structures are not
# guaranteed to match and a wrong guess would 404 on a site we do not control.
#
# These are 302s. Change to 301 if the arrangement is settled and you want search
# engines to treat it as permanent, bearing in mind browsers cache 301s hard.

/sigil    https://docs.usesigil.app/  302
/sigil/*  https://docs.usesigil.app/  302
